# WFORMTK.KEY - the checks of OK on dates, numbers and the check box;
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WFORMTK.SNP.
# TEXT and COND are filled in, so the field checked is the one tried.
K F5
T A
K TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB DOWN
K STAB STAB
K SPACE
S FLAGON
# A text of more than FORM_DATELEN digits is never a date.
K STAB
T 20261008X
K ENTER
S DATELONG
# QTY (FF_NONNEG) refuses -5 and 1x; the message differs.
K STAB STAB
T -5
K ENTER
S NEGQTY
K HOME SHIFT-END
T 1x
K ENTER
S BADQTY
# PRICE has 2 decimals at most.
K HOME SHIFT-END
T 7
K TAB
T 1.234
K ENTER
S PRICE3
K HOME SHIFT-END
T 12.5
K TAB
T 2026-13-45
K ENTER
S BADDATE
K HOME SHIFT-END
T 2026-10-08
K ENTER
S PASSED
